WEBVTT

00:10:28.561 --> 00:10:32.656
And we'll find hope
that there was a trustworthy adult

00:10:32.680 --> 00:10:34.410
who could say, "Genital response

00:10:34.434 --> 00:10:38.133
just means it was a sex-related stimulus;
doesn't mean it was wanted or liked,

00:10:38.157 --> 00:10:40.228
certainly doesn't mean
it was consented to.

00:10:41.124 --> 00:10:46.254
(Applause)

00:10:46.278 --> 00:10:51.276
That compassion and that hope
are why I travel all over,

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:53.410
talking about this
to anyone who will listen.

00:10:53.434 --> 00:10:57.402
I can see it helping people,
even as I say the words.

00:10:59.354 --> 00:11:02.385
I invite you to say the words.